Restoration – Pacific Palisades
Fire Remediation & Restoration – Windows and
Sliding Glass Doors (Labor Only)
Fire remediation and restoration of ten (10) large
windows and nine (9) sliding glass doors at 935
Chattanooga Ave, Pacific Palisades, CA 90272,
affected by smoke and soot exposure. Process
includes HEPA vacuum removal of soot and ash from
frames, tracks and assemblies, wet neutralization to
eliminate smoke film and odor, inspection and
adjustment of roller assemblies for proper alignment
and closure, silicone lubrication, and final operational
verification. Work performed under insurance
restoration protocols and post-fire remediation
standards.
